WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:04.161
♫ Why can't someone love
me like my best friend?

00:00:04.161 --> 00:00:06.762
♫ Indulge me when I show my gratitude ♫

00:00:06.762 --> 00:00:07.923
- What if your friends don't dance?

00:00:07.923 --> 00:00:09.548
- Yeah, then they're no
friends of mine essentially.

00:00:09.548 --> 00:00:10.964
- [Voiceover] Two Sumatran pour overs.

00:00:10.964 --> 00:00:11.661
- Thank you.

00:00:11.661 --> 00:00:13.240
- [Voiceover] Would you
guys like cream and sugar?

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:15.167
- No, we're good.
- Yeah, I would like...

00:00:15.167 --> 00:00:16.165
I would like cream and sugar.

00:00:16.165 --> 00:00:18.092
- We're fine.

00:00:18.092 --> 00:00:20.786
You hear that?

00:00:20.786 --> 00:00:23.340
That's that man in Central America

00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:25.430
who picked these beans by hand.

00:00:25.430 --> 00:00:27.635
Washed them, pulped them, roasted them,

00:00:27.635 --> 00:00:29.981
and you're like ah no buddy, I'm good.

00:00:29.981 --> 00:00:32.163
I'm just going to put, and ruin it.

00:00:32.163 --> 00:00:33.162
- Do you guys need a minute?

00:00:33.162 --> 00:00:34.044
- No.

00:00:34.044 --> 00:00:35.669
- No, no, no, I would
just like cream and...

00:00:35.669 --> 00:00:37.434
- For this, thank you.

00:00:37.434 --> 00:00:41.683
As your friend I'm going
to show you the way.

00:00:41.683 --> 00:00:43.076
Okay?

00:00:43.076 --> 00:00:45.160
If you don't want to see it that's fine.

00:00:54.732 --> 00:00:57.443
215 degrees really?

00:01:00.583 --> 00:01:05.004
Four degrees under boil point max.

00:01:05.004 --> 00:01:07.061
Well, well, well, well.

00:01:07.061 --> 00:01:10.939
Hmm, really wow.

00:01:10.939 --> 00:01:12.007
The big bubbles in the
pot when you're making

00:01:12.007 --> 00:01:15.554
the water.

00:01:19.112 --> 00:01:22.247
I'm going to do you a favor, okay?

00:01:22.247 --> 00:01:23.640
- Okay, check please?

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:27.564
♫ Why can't someone love
me like my best friend?

00:01:27.564 --> 00:01:31.018
♫ Indulge me when I show my gratitude ♫

